---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Indie 60 FPS Games for DroidDeck — DroidDeck Guide"
  description="Indie games that run at 60 FPS on DroidDeck. Verified lightweight titles for Android handhelds and Snapdragon phones."
  page="games"
>
  <style>
    .page-header{background:var(--night);color:white;padding:90px 0 50px}
    .page-header h1{font-size:36px;margin-bottom:12px}
    .page-header p{color:#93a7ba;max-width:600px}
    .page-content{padding:50px 0 80px}
    .game-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;font-size:14px}
    .game-table th,.game-table td{padding:14px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);text-align:left;vertical-align:top}
    .game-table th{background:#f4f7fa;font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--muted)}
    .game-table tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}
    .fps{font-weight:700;color:#16a34a}
    .note{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
    .badge{display:inline-block;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:#f0fdf4;color:#16a34a}
    .source-badge{font-size:11px;padding:3px 10px}
  </style>
  
    <section class="page-header">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="hero-label"><span></span> Game Compatibility</div>
        <h1>Indie 60 FPS Club</h1>
        <p>These lightweight indie games are verified to run at 60 FPS on Adreno 740 devices like Ayn Odin 2 and Snapdragon 8 Gen 2/3 phones.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-content wrap">
      <div style="overflow-x:auto">
        <table class="game-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Game</th>
              <th>Category</th>
              <th>Performance</th>
              <th>Recommended settings</th>
              <th>Source</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Hades</strong></td>
              <td>Action roguelike</td>
              <td><span class="fps">60 FPS</span></td>
              <td>1080p, High</td>
              <td><span class="source-badge source-verified"><i class="ri-shield-check-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> Verified</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Hollow Knight</strong></td>
              <td>Metroidvania</td>
              <td><span class="fps">60 FPS</span></td>
              <td>1080p, Max</td>
              <td><span class="source-badge source-verified"><i class="ri-shield-check-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> Verified</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Celeste</strong></td>
              <td>Platformer</td>
              <td><span class="fps">60 FPS</span></td>
              <td>1080p, Max</td>
              <td><span class="source-badge source-verified"><i class="ri-shield-check-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> Verified</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Dead Cells</strong></td>
              <td>Action roguelike</td>
              <td><span class="fps">60 FPS</span></td>
              <td>1080p, High</td>
              <td><span class="source-badge source-verified"><i class="ri-shield-check-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> Verified</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Stardew Valley</strong></td>
              <td>Simulation / RPG</td>
              <td><span class="fps">60 FPS</span></td>
              <td>1080p, Max</td>
              <td><span class="source-badge source-verified"><i class="ri-shield-check-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> Verified</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Shovel Knight</strong></td>
              <td>Retro platformer</td>
              <td><span class="fps">60 FPS</span></td>
              <td>1080p, Max</td>
              <td><span class="source-badge source-verified"><i class="ri-shield-check-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> Verified</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Hades II</strong></td>
              <td>Action roguelike</td>
              <td><span class="fps">50–60 FPS</span></td>
              <td>720p–1080p, Medium</td>
              <td><span class="source-badge source-community"><i class="ri-user-community-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> Community</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Ori and the Will of the Wisps</strong></td>
              <td>Platformer</td>
              <td><span class="fps">60 FPS</span></td>
              <td>720p, High</td>
              <td><span class="source-badge source-community"><i class="ri-user-community-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> Community</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Slay the Spire</strong></td>
              <td>Card roguelike</td>
              <td><span class="fps">60 FPS</span></td>
              <td>1080p, Max</td>
              <td><span class="source-badge source-verified"><i class="ri-shield-check-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> Verified</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Enter the Gungeon</strong></td>
              <td>Bullet hell</td>
              <td><span class="fps">60 FPS</span></td>
              <td>1080p, Max</td>
              <td><span class="source-badge source-verified"><i class="ri-shield-check-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> Verified</span></td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <p class="note" style="margin-top:20px"><span class="source-badge source-verified"><i class="ri-shield-check-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> Verified</span> entries were tested by our team on Adreno 740 devices. <span class="source-badge source-community"><i class="ri-user-community-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> Community</span> entries come from user reports. Results may vary with DroidDeck updates and game patches.</p>
    </section>
  
  
</Layout>
